     "title": "",
     "html": "<p>1-modul. Tadbirkorlik, tanqidiy va ijodiy fikrlash. Biznes imkoniyatlarni aniqlash | Ajratilgan vaqt: 2 soat (80 daqiqa)</p><h4>Bobning maqsadi</h4><p>Talabalarda tadbirkorlikni nazariy tushuncha sifatida emas, amaliy fikrlash tarzi va biznes yuritish jarayoni sifatida idrok etish, kundalik muammolarda biznes imkoniyatini ko‘ra olish hamda “muammo – yechim – mijoz – daromad manbayi” zanjirini tuzish ko‘nikmalarini shakllantirish.</p><h4>Tayanch tushunchalar</h4><p>Tadbirkor, tadbirkorlik tafakkuri, tavakkalchilik, chidamlilik, biznes imkoniyati, bozor bo‘shlig‘i (niche), trend, og‘riqli nuqta (pain point), mikrobiznes, startap, ijtimoiy tadbirkorlik, franshiza, tashabbus, ekotizim, inkubator, akselerator.</p>"
